  Flt3:
    'Flt3 (FLT3) shows up in oncology modeling because of angiogenesis and vascular stability signaling. Humanized checkpoint partners are often added when the readout is immunotherapy rather than tumor genetics alone. Knockout, conditional knockout, knockin, and humanized routes cover most oncology escalations at Flt3. A conventional knockout helps for tumor suppressor dosage studies when homozygous loss of Flt3 is tolerated long enough to score tumors. Start with conditional control if early lethality would erase your adult tumor window for Flt3. Orthotopic designs with engineered Flt3 alleles usually beat simple overexpression grafts for niche questions.',
