  Ifng:
    'Ifng comes up often in infection, autoimmunity, and tumor challenge studies. Human immune engraftment hosts plus a humanized Ifng target are a frequent pair for biologics studies. Checkpoint or cytokine partner crosses are common when a single Ifng mutant understates combination biology. Use cell restricted cKO when systemic loss confounds the read. Save humanized designs for antibody work on IFNG. Humanized Ifng matters when clinical antibodies bind human IFNG epitopes that mouse protein lacks. Inducible Cre after immune education finishes separates developmental effects from adult effector function.',
